#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Feature compatibility {#feature-compatibility}"
msgstr "Compatibility ng mga feature {#feature-compatibility}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Certain runtime features cannot be used together in a single job. Click the appropriate tab for a list of features that are incompatible with the selected feature:\n"
msgstr "Ang ilang mga feature ng runtime ay hindi maaaring gamitin nang magkasama sa isang trabaho. I-click ang naaangkop na accordion para sa listahan ng mga feature na hindi tugma sa napiling feature:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"Dynamic circuits\">\n"
"    Incompatible with:\n"
"  - Dynamical decoupling\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"Mga dynamic na circuit\">\n"
"    Hindi tugma sa:\n"
"  - Dynamical decoupling\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Other notes:\n"
"  - Gate twirling can be applied to dynamic circuits, but only to gates not inside conditional blocks. Measurement twirling can only be applied to terminal measurements.\n"
"  - Compatible with fractional gates when using `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.42.0 or later.\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"Dynamical decoupling\">\n"
"    Incompatible with:\n"
"  - Dynamic circuits\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"Fractional gates\">\n"
"    Incompatible with:\n"
"  - Gate twirling\n"
msgstr ""
"  Iba pang mga tala:\n"
"  - Maaaring ilapat ang gate twirling sa mga dynamic na circuit, ngunit sa mga gate lamang na hindi nasa loob ng mga conditional block. Ang measurement twirling ay maaari lamang ilapat sa mga terminal na pagsukat.\n"
"  - Tugma sa mga fractional gate kapag gumagamit ng `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.42.0 o mas bago.\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"Dynamical decoupling\">\n"
"    Hindi tugma sa:\n"
"  - Mga dynamic na circuit\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"Mga fractional gate\">\n"
"    Hindi tugma sa:\n"
"  - Gate twirling\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Compatible with dynamic circuits when using `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.42.0 or later.\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"Gate twirling\">\n"
"    Incompatible with:\n"
"  - Fractional gates\n"
"  - Stretches\n"
msgstr ""
"  Tugma sa mga dynamic na circuit kapag gumagamit ng `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.42.0 o mas bago.\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"  <AccordionItem title=\"Gate twirling\">\n"
"    Hindi tugma sa:\n"
"  - Mga fractional gate\n"
"  - Mga stretch\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Other notes:\n"
"  - Gate twirling can be applied to dynamic circuits, but only to gates not inside conditional blocks.\n"
"  - Measurement twirling can only be applied to terminal measurements.\n"
"  - Measurement twirling is incompatible with the [`store`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#store) instruction.\n"
"  - Does not work with non-Clifford entanglers.\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""
"  Iba pang mga tala:\n"
"  - Maaaring ilapat ang gate twirling sa mga dynamic na circuit, ngunit sa mga gate lamang na hindi nasa loob ng mga conditional block.\n"
"  - Ang measurement twirling ay maaari lamang ilapat sa mga terminal na pagsukat.\n"
"  - Ang measurement twirling ay hindi tugma sa instruksyon ng [`store`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#store).\n"
"  - Hindi gumagana sa mga non-Clifford entangler.\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Mga susunod na hakbang {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Review the [Introduction to options](/guides/runtime-options-overview) guide.\n"
"- Find more details about the `SamplerV2` methods in the [Sampler API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2).\n"
"- Decide what [execution mode](execution-modes) to run your job in.\n"
"- Learn about [noise management with Sampler](/guides/sampler-noise-management).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Mga rekomendasyon\">\n"
"- Suriin ang gabay na [Panimula sa mga opsyon](/guides/runtime-options-overview).\n"
"- Hanapin ang karagdagang detalye tungkol sa mga pamamaraan ng `SamplerV2` sa [reperensya ng API ng Sampler](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2).\n"
"- Magpasya kung anong [mode ng pagpapatakbo](execution-modes) ang gagamitin sa pagpapatakbo ng iyong trabaho.\n"
"- Matuto tungkol sa [pamamahala ng noise gamit ang Sampler](/guides/sampler-noise-management).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
